### ====================================================================
### patient-service - PostgreSQL / medflow_patients
### Todas as chamadas passam pelo API Gateway (porta 8080).
### ====================================================================

@gateway = http://localhost:8080

### Listar todos os pacientes
GET {{gateway}}/api/patients

### Buscar por id
GET {{gateway}}/api/patients/1

### Buscar por CPF
GET {{gateway}}/api/patients/cpf/11122233344

### Buscar por parte do nome
GET {{gateway}}/api/patients?name=ana

### Cadastrar um paciente
POST {{gateway}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "55566677788",
  "fullName": "Juliana Prado Martins",
  "birthDate": "1991-09-14",
  "email": "juliana.martins@email.com",
  "phone": "31988880005",
  "healthPlan": "Amil"
}

### Atualizar um paciente
PUT {{gateway}}/api/patients/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "11122233344",
  "fullName": "Ana Paula Ribeiro Costa",
  "birthDate": "1988-03-12",
  "email": "ana.costa@email.com",
  "phone": "31999990001",
  "healthPlan": "Unimed"
}

### Desativar (exclusao logica - o historico clinico e preservado)
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/patients/4

### ---- Casos de erro ----

### CPF duplicado -> 409 Conflict
POST {{gateway}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "11122233344",
  "fullName": "Paciente Repetido",
  "birthDate": "1990-01-01",
  "healthPlan": "SUS"
}

### Validacao -> 400 Bad Request com a lista de campos invalidos
POST {{gateway}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "123",
  "fullName": "AB",
  "birthDate": "2090-01-01",
  "email": "nao-e-email"
}

### Paciente inexistente -> 404 Not Found
GET {{gateway}}/api/patients/9999
